pentru a fi exportate.</p>

          </td>
          <td class="code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">type</span> <span class="nx">response2</span> <span class="kd">struct</span> <span class="p">{</span>
